1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,224
The Dragon Boat Festival is a fun holiday
端午节是一个有趣的节日

2
00:00:02,225 --> 00:00:03,423
We eat zongzi
我们吃粽子

3
00:00:03,424 --> 00:00:05,113
which are made of sticky rice
是糯米做的。

4
00:00:05,304 --> 00:00:06,944
We watch dragon boat races
我们看龙舟比赛

5
00:00:06,945 --> 00:00:08,833
The boats are long and colorful
船很长而且色彩鲜艳

6
00:00:09,064 --> 00:00:11,714
My family hangs calamus and mugwort on the door
我家在门上挂着香蒲艾蒿

7
00:00:12,025 --> 00:00:13,464
These plants bring good luck
这些植物带来好运

8
00:00:13,464 --> 00:00:16,463
We also wear perfume pouches to ward off evil spirits
我们还戴香水袋来辟邪

9
00:00:16,464 --> 00:00:20,722
I Love the Dragon Boat Festival because it is full of excitement and traditions
我喜欢端午节因为它充满了刺激和传统

